ent-CMUCargoCarrier = Bison remote cargo carrier
    .desc = A compact, semi-armored remote vehicle built to carry one crate through hazardous terrain.
ent-CMUCargoCarrierController = Bison cargo carrier controller
    .desc = A dedicated controller for pairing with and remotely piloting a Bison cargo carrier.
ent-CMUCargoCarrierWreck = Bison cargo carrier wreckage
    .desc = The scorched, obstructive remains of a Bison cargo carrier.
ent-CMUCargoCarrierDebris = Bison cargo carrier fragment
    .desc = A twisted, oil-stained fragment with no salvage value.
ent-CMUCargoCarrierDebrisSide = Bison cargo carrier side fragment
    .desc = A torn section of the Bison's wheel housing with no salvage value.
ent-CMUCargoCarrierDebrisHood = Bison cargo carrier hood fragment
    .desc = A twisted section of the Bison's armored hood with no salvage value.
ent-CMUCargoCarrierDebrisBumper = Bison cargo carrier bumper fragment
    .desc = A battered section of the Bison's bumper with no salvage value.
ent-CMUCrateCargoCarrier = Bison remote cargo carrier deployment crate
    .desc = A strapped deployment crate containing a controller and one full-size Bison remote cargo carrier.

ent-CMUActionCargoVehicleReturn = Return to body
    .desc = End remote control and return to your body.
ent-CMUActionCargoVehicleToggleBay = Toggle cargo bay
    .desc = Open or close the carrier's cargo bay.
ent-CMUActionCargoVehicleSelfDestruct = Arm self-destruct
    .desc = Irreversibly arm the carrier's five-second self-destruct sequence.

cmu-cargo-vehicle-verb-open = Open cargo bay
cmu-cargo-vehicle-verb-close = Close cargo bay
cmu-cargo-vehicle-verb-load = Load pulled crate
cmu-cargo-vehicle-verb-unload = Unload crate
cmu-cargo-vehicle-load-start = You begin loading the pulled crate.
cmu-cargo-vehicle-load-finished = You load {$crate} into the carrier.
cmu-cargo-vehicle-unload-start = You begin unloading the crate.
cmu-cargo-vehicle-unload-finished = You unload {$crate} from the carrier.
cmu-cargo-vehicle-bay-opened = The cargo bay opens.
cmu-cargo-vehicle-bay-closed = The cargo bay closes.
cmu-cargo-vehicle-pair-success = The controller pairs with {$vehicle}.
cmu-cargo-vehicle-pair-busy = The carrier is active or armed and cannot be rebound.
cmu-cargo-vehicle-controller-must-hold = You must hold the controller in your hand.
cmu-cargo-vehicle-controller-unpaired = The controller is not paired with a carrier.
cmu-cargo-vehicle-control-busy = The carrier is active or armed.
cmu-cargo-vehicle-control-unavailable = You cannot begin remote control right now.
cmu-cargo-vehicle-control-start = Remote control of {$vehicle} established.
cmu-cargo-vehicle-control-ended-manual = Remote control ended.
cmu-cargo-vehicle-control-ended-controller-dropped = Remote control ended because the controller left your hand.
cmu-cargo-vehicle-control-ended-controller-lost = Remote control ended because the controller was lost.
cmu-cargo-vehicle-control-ended-operator-disabled = Remote control ended because your body is incapacitated.
cmu-cargo-vehicle-control-ended-critical-damage = Critical damage detected. Automatic self-destruct armed.
cmu-cargo-vehicle-control-ended-disconnected = Remote control ended because the operator disconnected.
cmu-cargo-vehicle-control-ended-link-lost = The remote-control link was lost.
cmu-cargo-vehicle-control-ended-vehicle-lost = The cargo carrier was destroyed.
cmu-cargo-vehicle-cargo-armed = Cargo controls are locked during self-destruct.
cmu-cargo-vehicle-already-armed = The self-destruct sequence is already armed and cannot be stopped.
cmu-cargo-vehicle-auto-armed = CRITICAL DAMAGE. AUTOMATIC SELF-DESTRUCT ARMED.
cmu-cargo-vehicle-manual-armed = SELF-DESTRUCT ARMED. DETONATION IN FIVE SECONDS.
